# What Vercel never needs to receive.
#
# Vercel builds ONE thing in this repo: the static apps/web bundle, through the
# buildCommand in vercel.json (`bun run --filter '@hackmty/web' build`). The
# whole worktree is 8.6 MB, and 7.6 MB of that is the SAT snapshot and the
# judging assets, neither of which the web bundle imports. Trimming the upload
# is not a nicety: the 8.6 MB upload failed mid-flight on the venue Wi-Fi on
# 2026-09-12 and the trimmed one does not.
#
# Every workspace package.json stays, because `bun install --frozen-lockfile`
# resolves the whole workspace graph and fails on a missing member. If the build
# command here ever grows past apps/web, revisit the two package exclusions
# below first: they are safe only while apps/web and packages/core are the only
# sources Vite reads.

assets/
docs/
.github/
.githooks/
CHANGELOG.md

# Imported by packages/sat and packages/cep only, never by the web bundle.
packages/sat/src/snapshot/
packages/cep/src/fixtures/

# Brand and audit tooling, run locally and never at build time.
apps/web/brand/
apps/web/audit/
